            "detail": "The Data Analytics course was a complete game-changer for my career. Mastering SQL, Python, and Power BI through real-world projects gave me the confidence to crack my interviews. I am now working as a Data Analyst at Accenture, applying these skills daily!"
        },
        {
            "profession": "Data Scientist",
