            "imgSrc": "/images/testimonial/user-3.jpg",
            "starimg": "/images/testimonial/stars.png",
            "detail": "This GCP course is a must for anyone wanting to master Google Cloud. The deep dives into BigQuery, Kubernetes (GKE), and IAM policies were top-tier. I now manage cloud infrastructure for a leading fintech company in Europe."
        },
        {
            "profession": "Azure Administrator",
